!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/fixtures/validate-choice-shared-subtype.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/2026/40/m/meta.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/2026/40/m/core.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/fixtures/validate-choice-subtypes.tn"
@doc:"""
  A type IS-A both variants of a choice another schema declares ([TSON-SCHEMA] §5.4): `both` composes `a` and `b`,
  the variants of validate-choice-subtypes.tn's `either`. A schema importing a choice's may declare such a type, so
  neither schema is refused for it; a tag naming `both` at `either` names neither variant and selects none.
  """
!schema {
  both => a & b
}
